# Google Gemini API key used by the Roman Crisis Simulation client.
# Copy this file to .env (or .env.local) in the same directory and fill in a real key.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# SECURITY CAVEAT: roman_crisis_simulation/src/vite.config.ts currently
# inlines GEMINI_API_KEY into the client-side bundle at build time via its
# `define` block (process.env.API_KEY / process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY). This
# means the key is extractable by anyone who loads the built app in a
# browser. This is a known issue with a fix scheduled later (moving key
# usage behind a server-side proxy); do not treat this key as secret once
# the app is built and deployed.
